        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical lattice clocks have transformed precision measurement, reaching extraordinary reproducibility while enabling stringent tests and new sensing applications.",
        "attribution": "Katori introduced the decisive magic-wavelength lattice-clock concept; Ye made foundational experimental advances and established its broad precision capability.",
        "maturity": "The platform has been independently reproduced, continuously improved, and adopted internationally over many years.",
