      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Quantum control of mechanical motion has brought macroscopic resonators into the domain of quantum measurement, cooling, and coherent manipulation.",
        "attribution": "Aspelmeyer, Kippenberg, and Cleland made complementary experimental and conceptual contributions across optomechanical and electromechanical platforms.",
        "maturity": "Ground-state cooling and quantum-regime mechanical experiments have been independently demonstrated and extensively developed.",
