        "attribution": "Keller's semiconductor-saturable-absorber work was especially enabling; Sibbett and Moulton contributed major advances in ultrafast solid-state laser development.",
        "maturity": "The technology is long established, reproducible, and foundational to modern ultrafast optics.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Attribution spans several laser media, techniques, and a large community of contributors."
        ]
      }
    },
